{"source":"## Semantics: T1, T3, C1, C7, K1, V1, V2, A1, A2, M0\ngrammar ConformanceAtoms version \"1.0.0\" {\n  ## A word, separator, number - the lexical baseline.\n  main = (1*%x61-7A as text) \" \" (1*%x30-39 as digits)\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"abc 42\"\n    reject \"abc\"\n    reject \"ABC 42\"\n    capture \"ab 42\" { text: \"ab\"\n      digits: \"42\" }\n  }\n}\n","tokens":[{"type":"doc","value":"## Semantics: T1, T3, C1, C7, K1, V1, V2, A1, A2, M0","offset":0},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":52},{"type":"ident","value":"grammar","offset":53},{"type":"ident","value":"ConformanceAtoms","offset":61},{"type":"ident","value":"version","offset":78},{"type":"str","value":"\"1.0.0\"","offset":86},{"type":"punct","value":"{","offset":94},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":95},{"type":"doc","value":"## A word, separator, number - the lexical baseline.","offset":98},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":150},{"type":"ident","value":"main","offset":153},{"type":"punct","value":"=","offset":158},{"type":"punct","value":"(","offset":160},{"type":"num","value":"1","offset":161},{"type":"punct","value":"*","offset":162},{"type":"hex","value":"61-7A","offset":163},{"type":"ident","value":"as","offset":171},{"type":"ident","value":"text","offset":174},{"type":"punct","value":")","offset":178},{"type":"str","value":"\" \"","offset":180},{"type":"punct","value":"(","offset":184},{"type":"num","value":"1","offset":185},{"type":"punct","value":"*","offset":186},{"type":"hex","value":"30-39","offset":187},{"type":"ident","value":"as","offset":195},{"type":"ident","value":"digits","offset":198},{"type":"punct","value":")","offset":204},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":205},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":206},{"type":"ident","value":"entry","offset":209},{"type":"ident","value":"main","offset":215},{"type":"punct","value":":","offset":219},{"type":"ident","value":"main","offset":221},{"type":"newline","value":"\n","offset":2